--[[
    Zenthra-style UI Library
    Clean standalone rewrite. Single file. No obfuscation.
    
    Usage:
        local UI = loadstring(game:HttpGet("..."))()
        -- or local UI = require(path.to.this.module)
        
    Demo modules are included at the bottom and auto-load.
    Delete the "DEMO" section to use as a blank library.
]]

